{"title": "Summon Mephit (Grease)", "pageid": 41142, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Summon_Mephit_(Grease)", "categories": ["Class actions", "Actions", "Summoning actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Summon_Mephit_(disambiguation)\" title=\"Summon Mephit (disambiguation)\">Summon Mephit (disambiguation)</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Summon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Generic_Summon.webp/300px-Generic_Summon.webp, /w/images/2/26/Generic_Summon.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Generic_Summon.webp/300px-Generic_Summon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Generic_Summon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Summon Mephit</b> is a class action that allows a <a href=\"/wiki/Grease_Mephit\" title=\"Grease Mephit\">Grease Mephit</a> to summon a <a href=\"/wiki/Young_Grease_Mephit\" title=\"Young Grease Mephit\">Young Grease Mephit</a> from a Grease surface.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nForm a new Mephit from a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grease_(surface)\" title=\"Grease (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Grease_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Grease_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Grease_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Grease_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Grease_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Grease_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Grease\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Grease_surf